    "reviews": "\u201cThis single-serving Ghibli-esque adventure about work and worms will warm your heart\u201d<br>PCGAMER<br><br>\u201cLaura Shigihara\u2019s way of communicating complex emotions, while presenting so many more pieces of this beautiful world, is something to behold.\u201d<br>Games hub<br><br>\u201cHave you ever cried over a purple tie with a dessert pattern?\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Boss Level Gamer<br>",
